# Consultas da API de chamados. Executar com a API local ou ajustar a URL.
# Quando bearer estiver configurado, adicionar Authorization: Bearer <token> às consultas.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@startDate = 2026-10-12
@endDate = 2026-11-11

### Saúde do banco
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Opções dos filtros
# @name filterOptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/filters/options
Accept: application/json

### Indicadores gerais
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary?start_date={{startDate}}&end_date={{endDate}}
Accept: application/json

### Série diária de conclusões
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/tickets-by-period?start_date={{startDate}}&end_date={{endDate}}&group_by=day

### Série semanal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/tickets-by-period?start_date={{startDate}}&end_date={{endDate}}&group_by=week

### Série mensal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/tickets-by-period?start_date={{startDate}}&end_date={{endDate}}&group_by=month

### Distribuição por status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/status-distribution?start_date={{startDate}}&end_date={{endDate}}

### Tipos mais atendidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/top-ticket-types?start_date={{startDate}}&end_date={{endDate}}&limit=3

### Listagem paginada; executar antes do detalhe
# @name ticketPage
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets?page=1&page_size=10&sort_by=priority&sort_order=desc

### Detalhe do primeiro chamado da listagem anterior
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketPage.response.body.$.tickets[0].id}}

### Filtros combinados; executar opções antes para obter o tipo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets?start_date={{startDate}}&end_date={{endDate}}&status=resolved&priority=high&type_id={{filterOptions.response.body.$.options.types[0].id}}&assignee_id={{filterOptions.response.body.$.options.assignees[0].id}}

### Estado vazio válido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary?start_date=2020-01-01&end_date=2020-01-31

### 400: formato inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary?start_date=11-11-2026&end_date=2026-11-11

### 422: período invertido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary?start_date=2026-11-11&end_date=2026-10-01

### 404: chamado inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Contrato OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/openapi.json
